    <steps id="steps_062810246">
      <step>
        <cmd>When turning sharp corners, keep close to the inside corner. Begin the turn when the inside drive wheel meets the corner.</cmd>
        <info>
          <fig>
            <image href="../media/image801.png"/>
          </fig>
        </info>
      </step>
      <step>
        <cmd>In narrow aisles, keep away from the stockpile when turning into the aisle. Allow for counterweight swing.</cmd>
      </step>
    </steps>
  </taskbody>
